pshot age, concurrent heartbeat authority updates and partial vote persistence remain sourced surfaces.\",\n      \"Leadership-transfer edge cases, protocol-version compatibility and store error semantics are not exhaustively traced.\"\n    ],\n    \"core_gaps\": [],\n    \"status\": \"usable\",\n    \"rationale\": \"Representative formation and context paths, their voter/log/epoch connection and supporting recovery/application mechanisms have been read. This is a usable partial understanding, not a coverage claim.\"\n  },\n  \"understanding_changes\": [\n    {\n      \"operation_id\": \"b2b06cfb9f1147049c341317a53688b3\",\n      \"version\": 1,\n      \"record\": {\n        \"path\": \"state.json\",\n        \"collection\": \"selections\",\n        \"match\": {\n          \"operation_id\": \"b2b06cfb9f1147049c341317a53688b3\"\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"next_objective\": {\n    \"action\": \"investigate_and_refocus\",\n    \"boundary\": \"both_core_paths\",\n    \"reason\": \"Use results to update understanding and compare the remaining frontier\",\n    \"core_gaps\": []\n  },\n  \"drafts\": [],\n  \"candidates\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"dcba9912fc5d48c5ab9c0af853f5666a\",\n      \"question\": {\n        \"audit_spec_version\": 1,\n        \"disposition\": \"concrete_suspicion\",\n        \"preferred_check\": \"controlled_schedule\",\n        \"question\": \"Can successful VerifyLeader completion be established by nonvoter replication acknowledgments when the current leader lacks responses from a voter quorum, and what authority responsibility applies to that result?\",\n        \"importance\": \"Incorrect leadership confirmation can let an application return stale FSM data after another voter quorum has elected a leader; the current source discrepancy alone does not establish that complete history or endpoint.\",\n        \"source_ids\": [\n          \"s_verify_api\",\n          \"s_verify\",\n          \"s_notify\",\n          \"s_verify_count\",\n          \"s_leader\",\n          \"s_lease\",\n          \"s_suffrage\",\n          \"s_commit_consume\"\n        ],\n        \"participants\": [\n          \"Current leader\",\n          \"Voting peers\",\n          \"Nonvoting replication peers\",\n          \"VerifyLeader caller\"\n        ],\n        \"objects\": [\n          \"verifyFuture\",\n          \"followerReplication.notify\",\n          \"latest configuration\"\n        ],\n        \"contexts\": [\n          \"Stable mixed voter/nonvoter membership in one leader epoch\",\n          \"Replies during a selected communication partition before local stepdown\"\n        ],\n        \"event_paths\": [\n          \"VerifyLeader -> verifyCh -> verifyLeader -> each repl.notify -> heartbeat/append reply -> notifyAll -> vote -> verifyCh -> success\"\n        ],\n        \"activity_classes\": [\n          \"A2\"\n        ],\n        \"behavior_ids\": [\n          \"B_verify_ack\",\n          \"B_verify_result\"\n        ],\n        \"fact_ids\": [\n          \"F_verify_tally\"\n        ],\n        \"supporting_behavior_ids\": {\n          \"B_verify_register\": \"Sets voter-count threshold but registers all workers.\",\n          \"B_configuration\": \"Constructs mixed membership and broader replication-worker set.\",\n          \"B_leader_epoch\": \"Acquires authority and supplies competing lease/stepdown protection.\",\n          \"B_client\": \"Public VerifyLeader contract motivates use for avoiding stale reads.\"\n        },\n        \"obligation_relation_kind\": \"establishment\",\n        \"counterevidence\": [\n          \"Commitment uses only voter match indexes and lease checks explicitly count only voters.\",\n          \"Any negative registered response can cause failure; leader exit fails pending verification.\",\n          \"Lease timeout may end the relevant window; nonvoter presence alone does not show stale data or an elected successor.\"\n        ],\n        \"unknowns\": [\n          \"Clarify the